# Neon PostgreSQL — use in Render Environment Variables
#
# Option A — Npgsql format (recommended for Render):
# ConnectionStrings__Connection=Host=ep-xxx.region.aws.neon.tech;Port=5432;Database=neondb;Username=neondb_owner;Password=YOUR_PASSWORD;SSL Mode=Require;Trust Server Certificate=true
#
# Option B — Neon URI (works for ConnectionStrings__Connection OR DATABASE_URL):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:YOUR_PASSWORD@ep-xxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
#
# IMPORTANT: If you paste a postgresql:// URI, use it as DATABASE_URL or ConnectionStrings__Connection — both are auto-converted.
# Push schema locally:
# dotnet ef database update --project TraceServer.Data --startup-project Poulina.TraceServer.Api --connection "Host=...;SSL Mode=Require;Trust Server Certificate=true"
#
# Web Push (OS notifications on phone) — set on Render:
# Vapid__Subject=mailto:admin@agileai.com
# Vapid__PublicKey=your-vapid-public-key
# Vapid__PrivateKey=your-vapid-private-key
# Generate keys: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
